{"total": 398.118, "segs": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.149, "text": "Imagine waking up tomorrow... And discovering that every dollar in the world has disappeared.", "words": [{"text": "Imagine", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.42}, {"text": "waking", "start": 0.42, "end": 0.76}, {"text": "up", "start": 0.76, "end": 1.04}, {"text": "tomorrow...", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.86}, {"text": "And", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.2}, {"text": "discovering", "start": 2.2, "end": 2.6}, {"text": "that", "start": 2.6, "end": 2.92}, {"text": "every", "start": 2.92, "end": 3.4}, {"text": "dollar", "start": 3.4, "end": 3.84}, {"text": "in", "start": 3.84, "end": 4.14}, {"text": "the", "start": 4.14, "end": 4.28}, {"text": "world", "start": 4.28, "end": 4.76}, {"text": "has", "start": 4.76, "end": 5.32}, {"text": "disappeared.", "start": 5.32, "end": 5.8}]}, {"start": 6.599, "end": 13.91, "text": "Your bank account? Zero. Your wallet? Useless. Your savings? Gone.", "words": [{"text": "Your", "start": 6.599, "end": 6.719}, {"text": "bank", "start": 6.719, "end": 6.939}, {"text": "account?", "start": 6.939, "end": 7.279}, {"text": "Zero.", "start": 7.899, "end": 8.299}, {"text": "Your", "start": 9.139, "end": 9.339}, {"text": "wallet?", "start": 9.339, "end": 9.639}, {"text": "Useless.", "start": 10.579, "end": 11.099}, {"text": "Your", "start": 11.879, "end": 12.079}, {"text": "savings?", "start": 12.079, "end": 12.479}, {"text": "Gone.", "start": 13.379, "end": 13.679}]}, {"start": 14.361, "end": 23.329, "text": "Every millionaire, billionaire, and government on Earth... suddenly has absolutely nothing.", "words": [{"text": "Every", "start": 14.361, "end": 14.721}, {"text": "millionaire,", "start": 14.721, "end": 15.321}, {"text": "billionaire,", "start": 15.781, "end": 16.281}, {"text": "and", "start": 16.841, "end": 16.921}, {"text": "government", "start": 16.921, "end": 17.421}, {"text": "on", "start": 17.421, "end": 17.721}, {"text": "Earth...", "start": 17.721, "end": 18.561}, {"text": "suddenly", "start": 18.561, "end": 19.301}, {"text": "has", "start": 19.301, "end": 19.761}, {"text": "absolutely", "start": 19.761, "end": 20.841}, {"text": "nothing.", "start": 20.841, "end": 21.981}]}, {"start": 23.779, "end": 35.259, "text": "But here's the strange part. The food is still there. The houses are still there. The cars, factories, hospitals, and electricity still exist.", "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 23.779, "end": 24.074}, {"text": "here's", "start": 24.074, "end": 24.546}, {"text": "the", "start": 24.546, "end": 24.84}, {"text": "strange", "start": 24.84, "end": 25.371}, {"text": "part.", "start": 25.371, "end": 25.784}, {"text": "The", "start": 25.784, "end": 26.079}, {"text": "food", "start": 26.079, "end": 26.433}, {"text": "is", "start": 26.433, "end": 26.668}, {"text": "still", "start": 26.668, "end": 27.081}, {"text": "there.", "start": 27.081, "end": 27.553}, {"text": "The", "start": 27.553, "end": 27.848}, {"text": "houses", "start": 27.848, "end": 28.32}, {"text": "are", "start": 28.32, "end": 28.614}, {"text": "still", "start": 28.614, "end": 29.027}, {"text": "there.", "start": 29.027, "end": 29.499}, {"text": "The", "start": 29.499, "end": 30.339}, {"text": "cars,", "start": 30.339, "end": 31.179}, {"text": "factories,", "start": 31.599, "end": 31.959}, {"text": "hospitals,", "start": 32.379, "end": 32.799}, {"text": "and", "start": 33.219, "end": 33.419}, {"text": "electricity", "start": 33.419, "end": 33.999}, {"text": "still", "start": 33.999, "end": 34.579}, {"text": "exist.", "start": 34.579, "end": 34.979}]}, {"start": 35.709, "end": 46.476, "text": "So why would the world collapse? And more importantly... Would this finally make everyone equal? Let's find out.", "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 35.709, "end": 35.969}, {"text": "why", "start": 35.969, "end": 36.369}, {"text": "would", "start": 36.369, "end": 36.629}, {"text": "the", "start": 36.629, "end": 36.769}, {"text": "world", "start": 36.769, "end": 37.069}, {"text": "collapse?", "start": 37.069, "end": 37.729}, {"text": "And", "start": 38.689, "end": 38.769}, {"text": "more", "start": 38.769, "end": 38.929}, {"text": "importantly...", "start": 38.929, "end": 40.589}, {"text": "Would", "start": 40.589, "end": 40.789}, {"text": "this", "start": 40.789, "end": 41.089}, {"text": "finally", "start": 41.089, "end": 41.769}, {"text": "make", "start": 41.769, "end": 42.409}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 42.409, "end": 43.149}, {"text": "equal?", "start": 43.149, "end": 43.869}, {"text": "Let's", "start": 45.229, "end": 45.829}, {"text": "find", "start": 45.829, "end": 46.029}, {"text": "out.", "start": 46.029, "end": 46.309}]}, {"start": 47.276, "end": 55.915, "text": "It's seven a.m. You wake up, check your phone, and see a balance of zero. At first, you think it's a banking glitch.", "words": [{"text": "It's", "start": 47.276, "end": 47.556}, {"text": "seven", "start": 47.556, "end": 47.776}, {"text": "a.m.", "start": 47.776, "end": 49.016}, {"text": "You", "start": 49.016, "end": 49.156}, {"text": "wake", "start": 49.156, "end": 49.356}, {"text": "up,", "start": 49.356, "end": 49.596}, {"text": "check", "start": 49.916, "end": 50.076}, {"text": "your", "start": 50.076, "end": 50.276}, {"text": "phone,", "start": 50.276, "end": 50.616}, {"text": "and", "start": 50.896, "end": 51.216}, {"text": "see", "start": 51.216, "end": 51.436}, {"text": "a", "start": 51.436, "end": 51.516}, {"text": "balance", "start": 51.516, "end": 51.916}, {"text": "of", "start": 51.916, "end": 52.336}, {"text": "zero.", "start": 52.336, "end": 52.796}, {"text": "At", "start": 53.856, "end": 54.116}, {"text": "first,", "start": 54.116, "end": 54.396}, {"text": "you", "start": 54.596, "end": 54.656}, {"text": "think", "start": 54.656, "end": 54.796}, {"text": "it's", "start": 54.796, "end": 55.036}, {"text": "a", "start": 55.036, "end": 55.086}, {"text": "banking", "start": 55.086, "end": 55.336}, {"text": "glitch.", "start": 55.336, "end": 55.656}]}, {"start": 56.365, "end": 64.314, "text": "Then you check the news. Every bank on Earth is reporting the same thing. Money has vanished.", "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 56.365, "end": 56.625}, {"text": "you", "start": 56.625, "end": 56.805}, {"text": "check", "start": 56.805, "end": 57.065}, {"text": "the", "start": 57.065, "end": 57.225}, {"text": "news.", "start": 57.225, "end": 57.585}, {"text": "Every", "start": 58.405, "end": 58.665}, {"text": "bank", "start": 58.665, "end": 59.065}, {"text": "on", "start": 59.065, "end": 59.285}, {"text": "Earth", "start": 59.285, "end": 59.705}, {"text": "is", "start": 59.705, "end": 60.085}, {"text": "reporting", "start": 60.085, "end": 60.485}, {"text": "the", "start": 60.485, "end": 60.705}, {"text": "same", "start": 60.705, "end": 60.945}, {"text": "thing.", "start": 60.945, "end": 61.225}, {"text": "Money", "start": 62.145, "end": 62.605}, {"text": "has", "start": 62.605, "end": 63.525}, {"text": "vanished.", "start": 63.525, "end": 63.945}]}, {"start": 64.764, "end": 74.415, "text": "You rush to the supermarket. But when you reach the checkout, something strange happens. The cashier refuses to sell you anything.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 64.764, "end": 64.904}, {"text": "rush", "start": 64.904, "end": 65.204}, {"text": "to", "start": 65.204, "end": 65.464}, {"text": "the", "start": 65.464, "end": 65.604}, {"text": "supermarket.", "start": 65.604, "end": 66.084}, {"text": "But", "start": 66.764, "end": 67.004}, {"text": "when", "start": 67.004, "end": 67.144}, {"text": "you", "start": 67.144, "end": 67.284}, {"text": "reach", "start": 67.284, "end": 67.544}, {"text": "the", "start": 67.544, "end": 67.704}, {"text": "checkout,", "start": 67.704, "end": 68.084}, {"text": "something", "start": 68.664, "end": 68.884}, {"text": "strange", "start": 68.884, "end": 69.384}, {"text": "happens.", "start": 69.384, "end": 70.004}, {"text": "The", "start": 70.884, "end": 71.004}, {"text": "cashier", "start": 71.004, "end": 71.564}, {"text": "refuses", "start": 71.564, "end": 72.284}, {"text": "to", "start": 72.284, "end": 72.884}, {"text": "sell", "start": 72.884, "end": 73.224}, {"text": "you", "start": 73.224, "end": 73.544}, {"text": "anything.", "start": 73.544, "end": 74.084}]}, {"start": 74.865, "end": 80.444, "text": "Not because the store is empty. Because nobody knows what to charge.", "words": [{"text": "Not", "start": 74.865, "end": 75.105}, {"text": "because", "start": 75.105, "end": 75.405}, {"text": "the", "start": 75.405, "end": 75.645}, {"text": "store", "start": 75.645, "end": 75.945}, {"text": "is", "start": 75.945, "end": 76.165}, {"text": "empty.", "start": 76.165, "end": 76.525}, {"text": "Because", "start": 77.045, "end": 77.585}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 77.585, "end": 78.245}, {"text": "knows", "start": 78.245, "end": 78.885}, {"text": "what", "start": 78.885, "end": 79.445}, {"text": "to", "start": 79.445, "end": 79.725}, {"text": "charge.", "start": 79.725, "end": 80.145}]}, {"start": 80.894, "end": 87.641, "text": "The cashier doesn't want your phone, your watch, or your car. They want something they can actually use.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 80.894, "end": 81.014}, {"text": "cashier", "start": 81.014, "end": 81.494}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 81.494, "end": 81.894}, {"text": "want", "start": 81.894, "end": 82.034}, {"text": "your", "start": 82.034, "end": 82.174}, {"text": "phone,", "start": 82.174, "end": 82.634}, {"text": "your", "start": 83.074, "end": 83.134}, {"text": "watch,", "start": 83.134, "end": 83.514}, {"text": "or", "start": 83.914, "end": 83.964}, {"text": "your", "start": 83.964, "end": 84.134}, {"text": "car.", "start": 84.134, "end": 84.494}, {"text": "They", "start": 85.234, "end": 85.494}, {"text": "want", "start": 85.494, "end": 85.694}, {"text": "something", "start": 85.694, "end": 85.994}, {"text": "they", "start": 85.994, "end": 86.254}, {"text": "can", "start": 86.254, "end": 86.394}, {"text": "actually", "start": 86.394, "end": 86.914}, {"text": "use.", "start": 86.914, "end": 87.454}]}, {"start": 88.091, "end": 96.329, "text": "And suddenly, something becomes obvious. Money was never the food, the water, or the electricity.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 88.091, "end": 88.211}, {"text": "suddenly,", "start": 88.211, "end": 88.651}, {"text": "something", "start": 89.231, "end": 89.611}, {"text": "becomes", "start": 89.611, "end": 90.111}, {"text": "obvious.", "start": 90.111, "end": 90.631}, {"text": "Money", "start": 91.891, "end": 92.271}, {"text": "was", "start": 92.271, "end": 92.811}, {"text": "never", "start": 92.811, "end": 93.231}, {"text": "the", "start": 93.231, "end": 93.451}, {"text": "food,", "start": 93.451, "end": 93.971}, {"text": "the", "start": 94.371, "end": 94.451}, {"text": "water,", "start": 94.451, "end": 94.851}, {"text": "or", "start": 95.331, "end": 95.451}, {"text": "the", "start": 95.451, "end": 95.611}, {"text": "electricity.", "start": 95.611, "end": 96.011}]}, {"start": 96.779, "end": 101.389, "text": "It was simply the system that allowed strangers to exchange those things.", "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 96.779, "end": 96.899}, {"text": "was", "start": 96.899, "end": 97.059}, {"text": "simply", "start": 97.059, "end": 97.419}, {"text": "the", "start": 97.419, "end": 97.679}, {"text": "system", "start": 97.679, "end": 98.179}, {"text": "that", "start": 98.179, "end": 98.679}, {"text": "allowed", "start": 98.679, "end": 98.979}, {"text": "strangers", "start": 98.979, "end": 99.599}, {"text": "to", "start": 99.599, "end": 99.979}, {"text": "exchange", "start": 99.979, "end": 100.339}, {"text": "those", "start": 100.339, "end": 100.819}, {"text": "things.", "start": 100.819, "end": 101.139}]}, {"start": 101.839, "end": 108.47, "text": "And now that system is gone. But the real disaster hasn't even started.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 101.839, "end": 101.979}, {"text": "now", "start": 101.979, "end": 102.219}, {"text": "that", "start": 102.219, "end": 102.459}, {"text": "system", "start": 102.459, "end": 102.939}, {"text": "is", "start": 102.939, "end": 103.499}, {"text": "gone.", "start": 103.499, "end": 103.839}, {"text": "But", "start": 105.019, "end": 105.459}, {"text": "the", "start": 105.459, "end": 105.599}, {"text": "real", "start": 105.599, "end": 105.979}, {"text": "disaster", "start": 105.979, "end": 106.579}, {"text": "hasn't", "start": 106.579, "end": 107.419}, {"text": "even", "start": 107.419, "end": 107.679}, {"text": "started.", "start": 107.679, "end": 108.239}]}, {"start": 108.92, "end": 116.528, "text": "Without money, people would have to trade directly. This is called bartering. Sounds simple, right?", "words": [{"text": "Without", "start": 108.92, "end": 109.24}, {"text": "money,", "start": 109.24, "end": 109.7}, {"text": "people", "start": 110.18, "end": 110.54}, {"text": "would", "start": 110.54, "end": 110.76}, {"text": "have", "start": 110.76, "end": 110.92}, {"text": "to", "start": 110.92, "end": 111.06}, {"text": "trade", "start": 111.06, "end": 111.38}, {"text": "directly.", "start": 111.38, "end": 112.08}, {"text": "This", "start": 112.98, "end": 113.18}, {"text": "is", "start": 113.18, "end": 113.32}, {"text": "called", "start": 113.32, "end": 113.6}, {"text": "bartering.", "start": 113.6, "end": 114.34}, {"text": "Sounds", "start": 115.04, "end": 115.5}, {"text": "simple,", "start": 115.5, "end": 115.84}, {"text": "right?", "start": 116.12, "end": 116.34}]}, {"start": 116.978, "end": 125.742, "text": "Well, imagine you're a farmer. You have a hundred kilograms of potatoes, and you need medicine. You find a doctor willing to trade.", "words": [{"text": "Well,", "start": 116.978, "end": 117.238}, {"text": "imagine", "start": 117.598, "end": 117.978}, {"text": "you're", "start": 117.978, "end": 118.278}, {"text": "a", "start": 118.278, "end": 118.358}, {"text": "farmer.", "start": 118.358, "end": 118.758}, {"text": "You", "start": 119.518, "end": 119.658}, {"text": "have", "start": 119.658, "end": 119.818}, {"text": "a", "start": 119.818, "end": 119.918}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 119.918, "end": 120.258}, {"text": "kilograms", "start": 120.258, "end": 120.658}, {"text": "of", "start": 120.658, "end": 121.058}, {"text": "potatoes,", "start": 121.058, "end": 121.458}, {"text": "and", "start": 122.058, "end": 122.218}, {"text": "you", "start": 122.218, "end": 122.378}, {"text": "need", "start": 122.378, "end": 122.658}, {"text": "medicine.", "start": 122.658, "end": 123.098}, {"text": "You", "start": 123.918, "end": 124.038}, {"text": "find", "start": 124.038, "end": 124.278}, {"text": "a", "start": 124.278, "end": 124.418}, {"text": "doctor", "start": 124.418, "end": 124.698}, {"text": "willing", "start": 124.698, "end": 125.078}, {"text": "to", "start": 125.078, "end": 125.278}, {"text": "trade.", "start": 125.278, "end": 125.538}]}, {"start": 126.192, "end": 132.912, "text": "But there's a problem. The doctor doesn't want potatoes. He wants a new pair of shoes.", "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 126.192, "end": 126.242}, {"text": "there's", "start": 126.242, "end": 126.292}, {"text": "a", "start": 126.292, "end": 126.342}, {"text": "problem.", "start": 126.342, "end": 126.392}, {"text": "The", "start": 126.392, "end": 126.592}, {"text": "doctor", "start": 126.592, "end": 128.592}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 128.592, "end": 128.992}, {"text": "want", "start": 128.992, "end": 129.192}, {"text": "potatoes.", "start": 129.192, "end": 129.752}, {"text": "He", "start": 130.672, "end": 131.132}, {"text": "wants", "start": 131.132, "end": 131.392}, {"text": "a", "start": 131.392, "end": 131.572}, {"text": "new", "start": 131.572, "end": 131.812}, {"text": "pair", "start": 131.812, "end": 132.112}, {"text": "of", "start": 132.112, "end": 132.252}, {"text": "shoes.", "start": 132.252, "end": 132.612}]}, {"start": 133.362, "end": 140.25, "text": "So now you need to find a shoemaker who wants potatoes, get the shoes, and then return to the doctor.", "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 133.362, "end": 133.562}, {"text": "now", "start": 133.562, "end": 133.822}, {"text": "you", "start": 133.822, "end": 134.062}, {"text": "need", "start": 134.062, "end": 134.182}, {"text": "to", "start": 134.182, "end": 134.362}, {"text": "find", "start": 134.362, "end": 134.582}, {"text": "a", "start": 134.582, "end": 134.722}, {"text": "shoemaker", "start": 134.722, "end": 135.302}, {"text": "who", "start": 135.302, "end": 135.702}, {"text": "wants", "start": 135.702, "end": 135.942}, {"text": "potatoes,", "start": 135.942, "end": 136.522}, {"text": "get", "start": 136.982, "end": 137.522}, {"text": "the", "start": 137.522, "end": 137.702}, {"text": "shoes,", "start": 137.702, "end": 138.022}, {"text": "and", "start": 138.542, "end": 138.722}, {"text": "then", "start": 138.722, "end": 138.982}, {"text": "return", "start": 138.982, "end": 139.382}, {"text": "to", "start": 139.382, "end": 139.662}, {"text": "the", "start": 139.662, "end": 139.762}, {"text": "doctor.", "start": 139.762, "end": 140.042}]}, {"start": 140.7, "end": 148.008, "text": "And imagine doing this for everything. Fuel. Electricity. Clothes. Food.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 140.7, "end": 140.86}, {"text": "imagine", "start": 140.86, "end": 141.22}, {"text": "doing", "start": 141.22, "end": 141.54}, {"text": "this", "start": 141.54, "end": 141.96}, {"text": "for", "start": 141.96, "end": 142.4}, {"text": "everything.", "start": 142.4, "end": 142.96}, {"text": "Fuel.", "start": 143.58, "end": 144.24}, {"text": "Electricity.", "start": 144.86, "end": 145.62}, {"text": "Clothes.", "start": 146.02, "end": 146.88}, {"text": "Food.", "start": 147.5, "end": 147.72}]}, {"start": 148.458, "end": 156.497, "text": "This is one reason money became so important in human civilization. It made trade dramatically easier.", "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 148.458, "end": 148.638}, {"text": "is", "start": 148.638, "end": 148.758}, {"text": "one", "start": 148.758, "end": 148.998}, {"text": "reason", "start": 148.998, "end": 149.458}, {"text": "money", "start": 149.458, "end": 150.018}, {"text": "became", "start": 150.018, "end": 150.458}, {"text": "so", "start": 150.458, "end": 150.718}, {"text": "important", "start": 150.718, "end": 151.298}, {"text": "in", "start": 151.298, "end": 151.738}, {"text": "human", "start": 151.738, "end": 152.018}, {"text": "civilization.", "start": 152.018, "end": 152.738}, {"text": "It", "start": 153.638, "end": 153.818}, {"text": "made", "start": 153.818, "end": 154.018}, {"text": "trade", "start": 154.018, "end": 154.578}, {"text": "dramatically", "start": 154.578, "end": 155.578}, {"text": "easier.", "start": 155.578, "end": 156.238}]}, {"start": 156.947, "end": 164.117, "text": "But there's an even bigger problem. What happens to the people who don't own anything valuable to trade?", "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 156.947, "end": 157.137}, {"text": "there's", "start": 157.137, "end": 157.48}, {"text": "an", "start": 157.48, "end": 157.633}, {"text": "even", "start": 157.633, "end": 157.861}, {"text": "bigger", "start": 157.861, "end": 158.166}, {"text": "problem.", "start": 158.166, "end": 158.547}, {"text": "What", "start": 158.547, "end": 159.307}, {"text": "happens", "start": 159.307, "end": 160.067}, {"text": "to", "start": 160.067, "end": 160.327}, {"text": "the", "start": 160.327, "end": 160.407}, {"text": "people", "start": 160.407, "end": 160.727}, {"text": "who", "start": 160.727, "end": 161.287}, {"text": "don't", "start": 161.287, "end": 161.747}, {"text": "own", "start": 161.747, "end": 162.127}, {"text": "anything", "start": 162.127, "end": 162.547}, {"text": "valuable", "start": 162.547, "end": 163.187}, {"text": "to", "start": 163.187, "end": 163.527}, {"text": "trade?", "start": 163.527, "end": 163.907}]}, {"start": 164.567, "end": 170.585, "text": "And what happens to entire industries that depend on millions of transactions every single day?", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 164.567, "end": 164.707}, {"text": "what", "start": 164.707, "end": 164.907}, {"text": "happens", "start": 164.907, "end": 165.287}, {"text": "to", "start": 165.287, "end": 165.487}, {"text": "entire", "start": 165.487, "end": 166.007}, {"text": "industries", "start": 166.007, "end": 166.627}, {"text": "that", "start": 166.627, "end": 167.067}, {"text": "depend", "start": 167.067, "end": 167.427}, {"text": "on", "start": 167.427, "end": 167.727}, {"text": "millions", "start": 167.727, "end": 168.227}, {"text": "of", "start": 168.227, "end": 168.527}, {"text": "transactions", "start": 168.527, "end": 169.147}, {"text": "every", "start": 169.147, "end": 169.747}, {"text": "single", "start": 169.747, "end": 170.107}, {"text": "day?", "start": 170.107, "end": 170.467}]}, {"start": 171.035, "end": 176.812, "text": "Within days, the consequences spread. Factories struggle to operate. Why?", "words": [{"text": "Within", "start": 171.035, "end": 171.255}, {"text": "days,", "start": 171.255, "end": 171.755}, {"text": "the", "start": 172.095, "end": 172.175}, {"text": "consequences", "start": 172.175, "end": 172.675}, {"text": "spread.", "start": 172.675, "end": 173.255}, {"text": "Factories", "start": 173.915, "end": 174.715}, {"text": "struggle", "start": 174.715, "end": 175.235}, {"text": "to", "start": 175.235, "end": 175.495}, {"text": "operate.", "start": 175.495, "end": 175.895}, {"text": "Why?", "start": 176.415, "end": 176.635}]}, {"start": 177.262, "end": 188.934, "text": "Because a factory doesn't just need workers. It needs raw materials, electricity, transportation, spare parts, and thousands of agreements between different companies.", "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 177.262, "end": 177.582}, {"text": "a", "start": 177.582, "end": 177.782}, {"text": "factory", "start": 177.782, "end": 178.202}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 178.202, "end": 179.042}, {"text": "just", "start": 179.042, "end": 179.222}, {"text": "need", "start": 179.222, "end": 179.562}, {"text": "workers.", "start": 179.562, "end": 180.022}, {"text": "It", "start": 181.062, "end": 181.182}, {"text": "needs", "start": 181.182, "end": 181.442}, {"text": "raw", "start": 181.442, "end": 181.682}, {"text": "materials,", "start": 181.682, "end": 182.242}, {"text": "electricity,", "start": 182.582, "end": 183.082}, {"text": "transportation,", "start": 183.562, "end": 184.222}, {"text": "spare", "start": 184.682, "end": 185.022}, {"text": "parts,", "start": 185.022, "end": 185.602}, {"text": "and", "start": 186.022, "end": 186.102}, {"text": "thousands", "start": 186.102, "end": 186.722}, {"text": "of", "start": 186.722, "end": 186.982}, {"text": "agreements", "start": 186.982, "end": 187.322}, {"text": "between", "start": 187.322, "end": 187.802}, {"text": "different", "start": 187.802, "end": 188.222}, {"text": "companies.", "start": 188.222, "end": 188.682}]}, {"start": 189.384, "end": 192.526, "text": "And all of those systems depend heavily on money.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 189.384, "end": 189.524}, {"text": "all", "start": 189.524, "end": 189.844}, {"text": "of", "start": 189.844, "end": 189.964}, {"text": "those", "start": 189.964, "end": 190.124}, {"text": "systems", "start": 190.124, "end": 190.644}, {"text": "depend", "start": 190.644, "end": 191.004}, {"text": "heavily", "start": 191.004, "end": 191.524}, {"text": "on", "start": 191.524, "end": 192.064}, {"text": "money.", "start": 192.064, "end": 192.384}]}, {"start": 192.976, "end": 198.906, "text": "A truck driver won't necessarily transport food for a factory that can't offer anything useful in return.", "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 192.976, "end": 193.096}, {"text": "truck", "start": 193.096, "end": 193.336}, {"text": "driver", "start": 193.336, "end": 193.816}, {"text": "won't", "start": 193.816, "end": 194.216}, {"text": "necessarily", "start": 194.216, "end": 194.636}, {"text": "transport", "start": 194.636, "end": 195.176}, {"text": "food", "start": 195.176, "end": 195.676}, {"text": "for", "start": 195.676, "end": 195.936}, {"text": "a", "start": 195.936, "end": 196.036}, {"text": "factory", "start": 196.036, "end": 196.356}, {"text": "that", "start": 196.356, "end": 196.716}, {"text": "can't", "start": 196.716, "end": 197.116}, {"text": "offer", "start": 197.116, "end": 197.236}, {"text": "anything", "start": 197.236, "end": 197.576}, {"text": "useful", "start": 197.576, "end": 198.056}, {"text": "in", "start": 198.056, "end": 198.416}, {"text": "return.", "start": 198.416, "end": 198.676}]}, {"start": 199.356, "end": 206.659, "text": "A power company still needs workers to maintain the grid. A hospital needs medicine, equipment, and supplies.", "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 199.356, "end": 199.456}, {"text": "power", "start": 199.456, "end": 199.756}, {"text": "company", "start": 199.756, "end": 200.196}, {"text": "still", "start": 200.196, "end": 200.636}, {"text": "needs", "start": 200.636, "end": 200.916}, {"text": "workers", "start": 200.916, "end": 201.336}, {"text": "to", "start": 201.336, "end": 201.676}, {"text": "maintain", "start": 201.676, "end": 202.036}, {"text": "the", "start": 202.036, "end": 202.256}, {"text": "grid.", "start": 202.256, "end": 202.536}, {"text": "A", "start": 203.456, "end": 203.536}, {"text": "hospital", "start": 203.536, "end": 203.836}, {"text": "needs", "start": 203.836, "end": 204.336}, {"text": "medicine,", "start": 204.336, "end": 204.836}, {"text": "equipment,", "start": 205.136, "end": 205.436}, {"text": "and", "start": 205.836, "end": 205.896}, {"text": "supplies.", "start": 205.896, "end": 206.216}]}, {"start": 207.109, "end": 215.983, "text": "And suddenly, the biggest problem isn't that people have no money. It's that the systems connecting everything together are falling apart.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 207.109, "end": 207.249}, {"text": "suddenly,", "start": 207.249, "end": 207.609}, {"text": "the", "start": 208.009, "end": 208.089}, {"text": "biggest", "start": 208.089, "end": 208.289}, {"text": "problem", "start": 208.289, "end": 208.749}, {"text": "isn't", "start": 208.749, "end": 209.389}, {"text": "that", "start": 209.389, "end": 209.549}, {"text": "people", "start": 209.549, "end": 209.769}, {"text": "have", "start": 209.769, "end": 210.029}, {"text": "no", "start": 210.029, "end": 210.209}, {"text": "money.", "start": 210.209, "end": 210.549}, {"text": "It's", "start": 211.389, "end": 211.649}, {"text": "that", "start": 211.649, "end": 211.769}, {"text": "the", "start": 211.769, "end": 211.889}, {"text": "systems", "start": 211.889, "end": 212.349}, {"text": "connecting", "start": 212.349, "end": 212.989}, {"text": "everything", "start": 212.989, "end": 213.489}, {"text": "together", "start": 213.489, "end": 214.049}, {"text": "are", "start": 214.049, "end": 215.029}, {"text": "falling", "start": 215.029, "end": 215.369}, {"text": "apart.", "start": 215.369, "end": 215.669}]}, {"start": 216.433, "end": 224.862, "text": "Even if the world has enough food to feed everyone, getting that food to the right people becomes incredibly difficult.", "words": [{"text": "Even", "start": 216.433, "end": 216.733}, {"text": "if", "start": 216.733, "end": 216.993}, {"text": "the", "start": 216.993, "end": 217.173}, {"text": "world", "start": 217.173, "end": 217.433}, {"text": "has", "start": 217.433, "end": 217.693}, {"text": "enough", "start": 217.693, "end": 217.973}, {"text": "food", "start": 217.973, "end": 218.413}, {"text": "to", "start": 218.413, "end": 218.753}, {"text": "feed", "start": 218.753, "end": 219.133}, {"text": "everyone,", "start": 219.133, "end": 219.733}, {"text": "getting", "start": 220.473, "end": 220.773}, {"text": "that", "start": 220.773, "end": 221.053}, {"text": "food", "start": 221.053, "end": 221.393}, {"text": "to", "start": 221.393, "end": 221.633}, {"text": "the", "start": 221.633, "end": 221.773}, {"text": "right", "start": 221.773, "end": 222.033}, {"text": "people", "start": 222.033, "end": 222.453}, {"text": "becomes", "start": 222.453, "end": 223.153}, {"text": "incredibly", "start": 223.153, "end": 224.013}, {"text": "difficult.", "start": 224.013, "end": 224.533}]}, {"start": 225.312, "end": 239.32, "text": "But something unexpected starts happening. Some communities begin to survive better than others. And the reason isn't wealth. It's something much simpler.", "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 225.312, "end": 225.388}, {"text": "something", "start": 225.388, "end": 225.556}, {"text": "unexpected", "start": 225.556, "end": 225.74}, {"text": "starts", "start": 225.74, "end": 225.862}, {"text": "happening.", "start": 225.862, "end": 226.045}, {"text": "Some", "start": 226.045, "end": 226.137}, {"text": "communities", "start": 226.137, "end": 226.336}, {"text": "begin", "start": 226.336, "end": 226.443}, {"text": "to", "start": 226.443, "end": 226.504}, {"text": "survive", "start": 226.504, "end": 226.641}, {"text": "better", "start": 226.641, "end": 226.763}, {"text": "than", "start": 226.763, "end": 226.855}, {"text": "others.", "start": 226.855, "end": 226.993}, {"text": "And", "start": 226.993, "end": 227.069}, {"text": "the", "start": 227.069, "end": 227.145}, {"text": "reason", "start": 227.145, "end": 227.268}, {"text": "isn't", "start": 227.268, "end": 227.375}, {"text": "wealth.", "start": 227.375, "end": 227.512}, {"text": "It's", "start": 227.512, "end": 227.712}, {"text": "something", "start": 227.712, "end": 227.762}, {"text": "much", "start": 227.762, "end": 227.812}, {"text": "simpler.", "start": 227.812, "end": 227.862}]}, {"start": 239.77, "end": 245.689, "text": "In a world without money, your value would depend much more on what you can actually provide.", "words": [{"text": "In", "start": 239.77, "end": 239.89}, {"text": "a", "start": 239.89, "end": 239.99}, {"text": "world", "start": 239.99, "end": 240.27}, {"text": "without", "start": 240.27, "end": 240.57}, {"text": "money,", "start": 240.57, "end": 241.03}, {"text": "your", "start": 241.63, "end": 241.83}, {"text": "value", "start": 241.83, "end": 242.21}, {"text": "would", "start": 242.21, "end": 242.45}, {"text": "depend", "start": 242.45, "end": 242.75}, {"text": "much", "start": 242.75, "end": 243.25}, {"text": "more", "start": 243.25, "end": 243.65}, {"text": "on", "start": 243.65, "end": 244.03}, {"text": "what", "start": 244.03, "end": 244.19}, {"text": "you", "start": 244.19, "end": 244.33}, {"text": "can", "start": 244.33, "end": 244.49}, {"text": "actually", "start": 244.49, "end": 245.03}, {"text": "provide.", "start": 245.03, "end": 245.41}]}, {"start": 246.139, "end": 258.946, "text": "Farmers become incredibly important. Doctors become essential. Engineers, mechanics, electricians, and builders suddenly become some of the most valuable people in society.", "words": [{"text": "Farmers", "start": 246.139, "end": 246.799}, {"text": "become", "start": 246.799, "end": 247.259}, {"text": "incredibly", "start": 247.259, "end": 247.979}, {"text": "important.", "start": 247.979, "end": 248.659}, {"text": "Doctors", "start": 249.539, "end": 249.799}, {"text": "become", "start": 249.799, "end": 250.419}, {"text": "essential.", "start": 250.419, "end": 251.159}, {"text": "Engineers,", "start": 251.919, "end": 252.279}, {"text": "mechanics,", "start": 252.739, "end": 253.059}, {"text": "electricians,", "start": 253.479, "end": 254.159}, {"text": "and", "start": 254.299, "end": 254.349}, {"text": "builders", "start": 254.349, "end": 254.739}, {"text": "suddenly", "start": 254.739, "end": 255.579}, {"text": "become", "start": 255.579, "end": 256.139}, {"text": "some", "start": 256.139, "end": 256.539}, {"text": "of", "start": 256.539, "end": 256.699}, {"text": "the", "start": 256.699, "end": 256.799}, {"text": "most", "start": 256.799, "end": 256.999}, {"text": "valuable", "start": 256.999, "end": 257.499}, {"text": "people", "start": 257.499, "end": 257.939}, {"text": "in", "start": 257.939, "end": 258.299}, {"text": "society.", "start": 258.299, "end": 258.579}]}, {"start": 259.396, "end": 267.388, "text": "And someone with billions of dollars? Those billions wouldn't automatically give them food, water, or protection.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 259.396, "end": 259.656}, {"text": "someone", "start": 259.656, "end": 260.056}, {"text": "with", "start": 260.056, "end": 260.416}, {"text": "billions", "start": 260.416, "end": 260.916}, {"text": "of", "start": 260.916, "end": 261.296}, {"text": "dollars?", "start": 261.296, "end": 261.696}, {"text": "Those", "start": 262.576, "end": 262.996}, {"text": "billions", "start": 262.996, "end": 263.356}, {"text": "wouldn't", "start": 263.356, "end": 263.916}, {"text": "automatically", "start": 263.916, "end": 264.476}, {"text": "give", "start": 264.476, "end": 264.856}, {"text": "them", "start": 264.856, "end": 265.016}, {"text": "food,", "start": 265.016, "end": 265.416}, {"text": "water,", "start": 265.836, "end": 266.196}, {"text": "or", "start": 266.536, "end": 266.656}, {"text": "protection.", "start": 266.656, "end": 267.056}]}, {"start": 267.838, "end": 271.838, "text": "Meanwhile, a farmer with a small garden might be doing just fine.", "words": [{"text": "Meanwhile,", "start": 267.838, "end": 267.888}, {"text": "a", "start": 267.888, "end": 268.338}, {"text": "farmer", "start": 268.338, "end": 269.218}, {"text": "with", "start": 269.218, "end": 269.538}, {"text": "a", "start": 269.538, "end": 269.678}, {"text": "small", "start": 269.678, "end": 269.918}, {"text": "garden", "start": 269.918, "end": 270.358}, {"text": "might", "start": 270.358, "end": 270.798}, {"text": "be", "start": 270.798, "end": 270.958}, {"text": "doing", "start": 270.958, "end": 271.198}, {"text": "just", "start": 271.198, "end": 271.398}, {"text": "fine.", "start": 271.398, "end": 271.698}]}, {"start": 272.288, "end": 280.347, "text": "But don't celebrate just yet. Because removing money doesn't automatically remove greed, power, or inequality.", "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 272.288, "end": 272.338}, {"text": "don't", "start": 272.338, "end": 272.388}, {"text": "celebrate", "start": 272.388, "end": 272.438}, {"text": "just", "start": 272.438, "end": 272.488}, {"text": "yet.", "start": 272.488, "end": 272.538}, {"text": "Because", "start": 272.538, "end": 273.808}, {"text": "removing", "start": 273.808, "end": 275.068}, {"text": "money", "start": 275.068, "end": 275.608}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 275.608, "end": 276.388}, {"text": "automatically", "start": 276.388, "end": 277.048}, {"text": "remove", "start": 277.048, "end": 277.468}, {"text": "greed,", "start": 277.468, "end": 278.008}, {"text": "power,", "start": 278.388, "end": 278.808}, {"text": "or", "start": 279.368, "end": 279.448}, {"text": "inequality.", "start": 279.448, "end": 279.848}]}, {"start": 280.797, "end": 292.702, "text": "People could still compete for land, food, resources, and influence. In fact, whoever controls the most important resources might become the new powerful elite.", "words": [{"text": "People", "start": 280.797, "end": 281.017}, {"text": "could", "start": 281.017, "end": 281.217}, {"text": "still", "start": 281.217, "end": 281.497}, {"text": "compete", "start": 281.497, "end": 281.937}, {"text": "for", "start": 281.937, "end": 282.237}, {"text": "land,", "start": 282.237, "end": 282.637}, {"text": "food,", "start": 282.937, "end": 283.317}, {"text": "resources,", "start": 283.737, "end": 284.197}, {"text": "and", "start": 284.817, "end": 284.897}, {"text": "influence.", "start": 284.897, "end": 285.417}, {"text": "In", "start": 286.357, "end": 286.517}, {"text": "fact,", "start": 286.517, "end": 286.817}, {"text": "whoever", "start": 287.337, "end": 287.577}, {"text": "controls", "start": 287.577, "end": 288.157}, {"text": "the", "start": 288.157, "end": 288.357}, {"text": "most", "start": 288.357, "end": 288.537}, {"text": "important", "start": 288.537, "end": 289.057}, {"text": "resources", "start": 289.057, "end": 289.617}, {"text": "might", "start": 289.617, "end": 290.237}, {"text": "become", "start": 290.237, "end": 290.617}, {"text": "the", "start": 290.617, "end": 290.857}, {"text": "new", "start": 290.857, "end": 291.197}, {"text": "powerful", "start": 291.197, "end": 291.837}, {"text": "elite.", "start": 291.837, "end": 292.357}]}, {"start": 293.152, "end": 298.044, "text": "Money would disappear. But the struggle for power wouldn't.", "words": [{"text": "Money", "start": 293.152, "end": 293.532}, {"text": "would", "start": 293.532, "end": 294.072}, {"text": "disappear.", "start": 294.072, "end": 294.512}, {"text": "But", "start": 295.572, "end": 295.832}, {"text": "the", "start": 295.832, "end": 295.972}, {"text": "struggle", "start": 295.972, "end": 296.332}, {"text": "for", "start": 296.332, "end": 296.592}, {"text": "power", "start": 296.592, "end": 297.052}, {"text": "wouldn't.", "start": 297.052, "end": 297.892}]}, {"start": 298.494, "end": 303.962, "text": "Eventually, humanity would have to invent a new way to organize society.", "words": [{"text": "Eventually,", "start": 298.494, "end": 299.134}, {"text": "humanity", "start": 299.514, "end": 300.054}, {"text": "would", "start": 300.054, "end": 300.394}, {"text": "have", "start": 300.394, "end": 300.654}, {"text": "to", "start": 300.654, "end": 300.874}, {"text": "invent", "start": 300.874, "end": 301.214}, {"text": "a", "start": 301.214, "end": 301.674}, {"text": "new", "start": 301.674, "end": 302.034}, {"text": "way", "start": 302.034, "end": 302.414}, {"text": "to", "start": 302.414, "end": 302.774}, {"text": "organize", "start": 302.774, "end": 303.114}, {"text": "society.", "start": 303.114, "end": 303.734}]}, {"start": 304.412, "end": 313.683, "text": "Some communities might distribute resources based on need. Others might use barter, favors, or local systems of exchange.", "words": [{"text": "Some", "start": 304.412, "end": 304.672}, {"text": "communities", "start": 304.672, "end": 305.152}, {"text": "might", "start": 305.152, "end": 305.572}, {"text": "distribute", "start": 305.572, "end": 306.072}, {"text": "resources", "start": 306.072, "end": 306.652}, {"text": "based", "start": 306.652, "end": 307.012}, {"text": "on", "start": 307.012, "end": 307.372}, {"text": "need.", "start": 307.372, "end": 307.792}, {"text": "Others", "start": 308.772, "end": 309.072}, {"text": "might", "start": 309.072, "end": 309.652}, {"text": "use", "start": 309.652, "end": 310.012}, {"text": "barter,", "start": 310.012, "end": 310.672}, {"text": "favors,", "start": 310.972, "end": 311.352}, {"text": "or", "start": 311.932, "end": 312.012}, {"text": "local", "start": 312.012, "end": 312.352}, {"text": "systems", "start": 312.352, "end": 312.772}, {"text": "of", "start": 312.772, "end": 312.972}, {"text": "exchange.", "start": 312.972, "end": 313.352}]}, {"start": 314.133, "end": 319.573, "text": "Governments could introduce rationing to make sure essential supplies reach everyone.", "words": [{"text": "Governments", "start": 314.133, "end": 314.673}, {"text": "could", "start": 314.673, "end": 314.853}, {"text": "introduce", "start": 314.853, "end": 315.293}, {"text": "rationing", "start": 315.293, "end": 316.193}, {"text": "to", "start": 316.193, "end": 316.553}, {"text": "make", "start": 316.553, "end": 316.733}, {"text": "sure", "start": 316.733, "end": 316.973}, {"text": "essential", "start": 316.973, "end": 317.533}, {"text": "supplies", "start": 317.533, "end": 318.173}, {"text": "reach", "start": 318.173, "end": 318.753}, {"text": "everyone.", "start": 318.753, "end": 319.353}]}, {"start": 320.023, "end": 333.488, "text": "And perhaps, over time, something new would emerge. A system of digital credits. Trading tokens. Or another universal way to measure value.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 320.023, "end": 320.143}, {"text": "perhaps,", "start": 320.143, "end": 320.563}, {"text": "over", "start": 320.763, "end": 320.883}, {"text": "time,", "start": 320.883, "end": 321.303}, {"text": "something", "start": 322.043, "end": 322.243}, {"text": "new", "start": 322.243, "end": 322.663}, {"text": "would", "start": 322.663, "end": 322.923}, {"text": "emerge.", "start": 322.923, "end": 323.323}, {"text": "A", "start": 324.443, "end": 324.603}, {"text": "system", "start": 324.603, "end": 324.943}, {"text": "of", "start": 324.943, "end": 325.623}, {"text": "digital", "start": 325.623, "end": 326.123}, {"text": "credits.", "start": 326.123, "end": 327.043}, {"text": "Trading", "start": 328.083, "end": 328.503}, {"text": "tokens.", "start": 328.503, "end": 328.963}, {"text": "Or", "start": 330.023, "end": 330.343}, {"text": "another", "start": 330.343, "end": 330.663}, {"text": "universal", "start": 330.663, "end": 331.463}, {"text": "way", "start": 331.463, "end": 331.903}, {"text": "to", "start": 331.903, "end": 332.423}, {"text": "measure", "start": 332.423, "end": 332.843}, {"text": "value.", "start": 332.843, "end": 333.383}]}, {"start": 333.938, "end": 338.786, "text": "Because here's the truth. Money isn't just paper or numbers on a screen.", "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 333.938, "end": 334.463}, {"text": "here's", "start": 334.463, "end": 334.93}, {"text": "the", "start": 334.93, "end": 335.221}, {"text": "truth.", "start": 335.221, "end": 335.688}, {"text": "Money", "start": 335.688, "end": 335.958}, {"text": "isn't", "start": 335.958, "end": 336.478}, {"text": "just", "start": 336.478, "end": 336.598}, {"text": "paper", "start": 336.598, "end": 337.098}, {"text": "or", "start": 337.098, "end": 337.538}, {"text": "numbers", "start": 337.538, "end": 337.918}, {"text": "on", "start": 337.918, "end": 338.138}, {"text": "a", "start": 338.138, "end": 338.238}, {"text": "screen.", "start": 338.238, "end": 338.558}]}, {"start": 339.236, "end": 344.239, "text": "It's a tool that helps billions of strangers cooperate without having to know each other.", "words": [{"text": "It's", "start": 339.236, "end": 339.456}, {"text": "a", "start": 339.456, "end": 339.506}, {"text": "tool", "start": 339.506, "end": 339.776}, {"text": "that", "start": 339.776, "end": 339.996}, {"text": "helps", "start": 339.996, "end": 340.336}, {"text": "billions", "start": 340.336, "end": 340.796}, {"text": "of", "start": 340.796, "end": 341.136}, {"text": "strangers", "start": 341.136, "end": 341.636}, {"text": "cooperate", "start": 341.636, "end": 342.216}, {"text": "without", "start": 342.216, "end": 343.076}, {"text": "having", "start": 343.076, "end": 343.416}, {"text": "to", "start": 343.416, "end": 343.556}, {"text": "know", "start": 343.556, "end": 343.776}, {"text": "each", "start": 343.776, "end": 343.976}, {"text": "other.", "start": 343.976, "end": 344.156}]}, {"start": 344.689, "end": 352.753, "text": "Remove that tool, and humanity would need to build another one. And that brings us to the biggest question.", "words": [{"text": "Remove", "start": 344.689, "end": 344.969}, {"text": "that", "start": 344.969, "end": 345.389}, {"text": "tool,", "start": 345.389, "end": 345.789}, {"text": "and", "start": 346.409, "end": 346.689}, {"text": "humanity", "start": 346.689, "end": 347.149}, {"text": "would", "start": 347.149, "end": 347.429}, {"text": "need", "start": 347.429, "end": 347.669}, {"text": "to", "start": 347.669, "end": 347.889}, {"text": "build", "start": 347.889, "end": 348.209}, {"text": "another", "start": 348.209, "end": 348.769}, {"text": "one.", "start": 348.769, "end": 349.089}, {"text": "And", "start": 350.369, "end": 350.609}, {"text": "that", "start": 350.609, "end": 350.789}, {"text": "brings", "start": 350.789, "end": 351.029}, {"text": "us", "start": 351.029, "end": 351.269}, {"text": "to", "start": 351.269, "end": 351.469}, {"text": "the", "start": 351.469, "end": 351.569}, {"text": "biggest", "start": 351.569, "end": 351.909}, {"text": "question.", "start": 351.909, "end": 352.509}]}, {"start": 353.203, "end": 362.322, "text": "So, would the world become a better place without money? Maybe in some ways. But probably not in the way you imagine.", "words": [{"text": "So,", "start": 353.203, "end": 353.563}, {"text": "would", "start": 354.223, "end": 354.503}, {"text": "the", "start": 354.503, "end": 354.643}, {"text": "world", "start": 354.643, "end": 354.903}, {"text": "become", "start": 354.903, "end": 355.243}, {"text": "a", "start": 355.243, "end": 355.383}, {"text": "better", "start": 355.383, "end": 355.743}, {"text": "place", "start": 355.743, "end": 356.283}, {"text": "without", "start": 356.283, "end": 356.623}, {"text": "money?", "start": 356.623, "end": 357.003}, {"text": "Maybe", "start": 357.943, "end": 358.383}, {"text": "in", "start": 358.383, "end": 358.563}, {"text": "some", "start": 358.563, "end": 358.783}, {"text": "ways.", "start": 358.783, "end": 359.123}, {"text": "But", "start": 359.983, "end": 360.223}, {"text": "probably", "start": 360.223, "end": 360.723}, {"text": "not", "start": 360.723, "end": 361.063}, {"text": "in", "start": 361.063, "end": 361.283}, {"text": "the", "start": 361.283, "end": 361.383}, {"text": "way", "start": 361.383, "end": 361.603}, {"text": "you", "start": 361.603, "end": 361.823}, {"text": "imagine.", "start": 361.823, "end": 362.063}]}, {"start": 362.772, "end": 371.298, "text": "We wouldn't suddenly become equal. We wouldn't stop competing. And we certainly wouldn't stop needing things.", "words": [{"text": "We", "start": 362.772, "end": 362.912}, {"text": "wouldn't", "start": 362.912, "end": 363.212}, {"text": "suddenly", "start": 363.212, "end": 363.492}, {"text": "become", "start": 363.492, "end": 363.872}, {"text": "equal.", "start": 363.872, "end": 364.572}, {"text": "We", "start": 365.372, "end": 365.592}, {"text": "wouldn't", "start": 365.592, "end": 365.892}, {"text": "stop", "start": 365.892, "end": 366.132}, {"text": "competing.", "start": 366.132, "end": 366.872}, {"text": "And", "start": 367.932, "end": 368.132}, {"text": "we", "start": 368.132, "end": 368.252}, {"text": "certainly", "start": 368.252, "end": 368.832}, {"text": "wouldn't", "start": 368.832, "end": 369.412}, {"text": "stop", "start": 369.412, "end": 369.712}, {"text": "needing", "start": 369.712, "end": 370.412}, {"text": "things.", "start": 370.412, "end": 370.972}]}, {"start": 371.748, "end": 381.853, "text": "Because money was never the thing that made the world valuable. It was the system we created to exchange what was already valuable.", "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 371.748, "end": 371.798}, {"text": "money", "start": 371.798, "end": 371.848}, {"text": "was", "start": 371.848, "end": 371.898}, {"text": "never", "start": 371.898, "end": 371.948}, {"text": "the", "start": 371.948, "end": 371.998}, {"text": "thing", "start": 371.998, "end": 372.048}, {"text": "that", "start": 372.048, "end": 372.098}, {"text": "made", "start": 372.098, "end": 372.148}, {"text": "the", "start": 372.148, "end": 372.198}, {"text": "world", "start": 372.198, "end": 372.248}, {"text": "valuable.", "start": 372.248, "end": 372.298}, {"text": "It", "start": 372.298, "end": 372.988}, {"text": "was", "start": 372.988, "end": 373.068}, {"text": "the", "start": 373.068, "end": 373.648}, {"text": "system", "start": 373.648, "end": 377.608}, {"text": "we", "start": 377.608, "end": 377.848}, {"text": "created", "start": 377.848, "end": 378.368}, {"text": "to", "start": 378.368, "end": 378.948}, {"text": "exchange", "start": 378.948, "end": 379.488}, {"text": "what", "start": 379.488, "end": 380.028}, {"text": "was", "start": 380.028, "end": 380.288}, {"text": "already", "start": 380.288, "end": 380.908}, {"text": "valuable.", "start": 380.908, "end": 381.608}]}, {"start": 382.303, "end": 392.434, "text": "And if money disappeared tomorrow... The most valuable thing in the world might simply be the person who knows how to keep everyone alive.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 382.303, "end": 382.463}, {"text": "if", "start": 382.463, "end": 382.603}, {"text": "money", "start": 382.603, "end": 382.983}, {"text": "disappeared", "start": 382.983, "end": 383.543}, {"text": "tomorrow...", "start": 383.543, "end": 385.283}, {"text": "The", "start": 385.283, "end": 385.423}, {"text": "most", "start": 385.423, "end": 385.603}, {"text": "valuable", "start": 385.603, "end": 386.003}, {"text": "thing", "start": 386.003, "end": 386.363}, {"text": "in", "start": 386.363, "end": 386.543}, {"text": "the", "start": 386.543, "end": 386.643}, {"text": "world", "start": 386.643, "end": 387.063}, {"text": "might", "start": 387.063, "end": 387.743}, {"text": "simply", "start": 387.743, "end": 388.283}, {"text": "be", "start": 388.283, "end": 388.563}, {"text": "the", "start": 388.563, "end": 388.723}, {"text": "person", "start": 388.723, "end": 389.123}, {"text": "who", "start": 389.123, "end": 389.703}, {"text": "knows", "start": 389.703, "end": 389.963}, {"text": "how", "start": 389.963, "end": 390.263}, {"text": "to", "start": 390.263, "end": 390.383}, {"text": "keep", "start": 390.383, "end": 390.603}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 390.603, "end": 391.283}, {"text": "alive.", "start": 391.283, "end": 392.023}]}, {"start": 392.884, "end": 395.918, "text": "What would you do in a world without money?", "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 392.884, "end": 393.064}, {"text": "would", "start": 393.064, "end": 393.284}, {"text": "you", "start": 393.284, "end": 393.604}, {"text": "do", "start": 393.604, "end": 393.944}, {"text": "in", "start": 393.944, "end": 394.404}, {"text": "a", "start": 394.404, "end": 394.524}, {"text": "world", "start": 394.524, "end": 394.884}, {"text": "without", "start": 394.884, "end": 395.304}, {"text": "money?", "start": 395.304, "end": 395.724}]}]}